# decision-when-reduction root (#189 Slice-C boundary 1)
library "Pol".

// A decision whose `when` guard IS a reduction concept ("Cov" = `code is` Condition +
// `exists this`). Exercises the boundary-1 lane crux: the reduction classifies Inferred and
// re-exports BARE through the Interface layer (a TOTAL boolean has no `.satisfied()`), and the
// FHIR case-feature lane LOUD-GATES it (a reduction case-feature SD's featureExpression would
// dangle at $apply, so it is refused rather than shipped).

concept "Cov":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- shape is Scalar.
- code is `cov`.
- definition is exists this.

decision "Cov Determination":
first:
- when "Cov" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage determination: APPROVE / Certified.`.
activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage determination: DENY / Not Certified.`.
